  m_Name: Motel
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DevSidePage
  leftPageInfo: '<align=center><size=140%>- Motel -</size></align>

    Motel is
    a villager building, you can have multiple at a time.


    <align=center><size=120%>-
    Usage -</size></align>

    House up to <color=#305D42><size=110%><i>3</i></size></color>
    villagers to sleep during the night.


'
  leftPageLayout: 1
  leftPageIcons:
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: f8f85ea8749c07d4d93ac250965ab3ce, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: abb79316e90b519469bcb5324d99e1aa, type: 3}
  leftPageWidth: 55
  leftPageHeight: 110
  leftPageSpacing: 30
  leftPagePadding:
    m_Left: 0
    m_Right: 0
    m_Top: 25
    m_Bottom: 0
  rightPageInfo: '<align=center><size=120%>- Benefits -</size></align>


    Housed
    villagers don''t lose <color=#305D42><size=110%><i>hunger</i></size></color>
    while sleeping and increase <color=#305D42><size=110%><i>Global Morality</i></size></color>


    <align=center><size=120%>-
    Warning -</size></align>

    Homeless villagers will decrease <color=#305D42><size=110%><i>Global
    Morality</i></size></color> every night they don''t sleep.'
